  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint War; <strong>CL</strong> 4th; <strong>SP</strong> 1<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 4,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 2 lbs.<br>\n<strong>Range</strong> 60-ft. radius, centered on caster</p>\n<p>Totem wands contain the War sphere and one additional (totem) talent, chosen when the spell engine is made. While these spell engines are not especially powerful, relaxed casters occasionally use these in lieu of actually casting their spells as a way of supporting their allies.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Spell Engine, War sphere (any (totem) talent); <strong>Cost</strong> 2,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spell-engines#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
